    "description": {
      "value": "This palm-sized chunk of wood it rotting, and riddled with mold and fungi. You can crush this wood to use it as a spell catalyst when you cast a oaken resilience. When you do, the bark that covers your skin is rotting, and emits a small cloud of spores whenever your hurt. For the duration, whenever you take physical damage, your rotting bark skin emits a cloud of spores in the listed emanation. Creatures in the area must attempt a Fortitude save at the listed DC to avoid taking the listed poison damage.\n\nThe DC is 21, the area is a 5-foot emanation, and the poison damage is 1d4."
    },
